    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been feeling really low lately and i want to try something more natural for my mood. i was thinking about starting st johns wort, but i'm currently on the pill (combined oral contraceptive). do u think it's okay to take them together?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you do not combine St. John's Wort with birth control pills. St. John's Wort can significantly affect how your body processes medications, potentially making your birth control less effective. Because of this serious interaction, you should speak with your doctor or pharmacist before taking St. John's Wort. They can provide safe, personalized advice regarding your current medications and mood concerns.",
